This directory is quarantined research/reference material, not package support.

It preserves the former Molt-owned tinygrad semantics clone for archaeology,
science, regression comparison, and primitive-model reference only. Production
tinygrad support must compile upstream tinygrad through package/import custody.

Do not add this directory to PYTHONPATH, MOLT_MODULE_ROOTS, module roots,
build inputs, runtime packages, wheels, or import resolution. Tests that need
the reference behavior must load it explicitly through
tests/helpers/tinygrad_stdlib_loader.py.
